    "**Figure interpretation.** The connected-leg representation retains the hydrostatic\n",
    "direction of the sag, arch, and riser. It is a hydraulic centerline model, not a\n",
    "catenary, bending-stiffness, or structural equilibrium calculation."
   ]
  },
  {
